<topic id="GUID-D293C09A-8D8D-4BF1-BF1A-B690416BFFEA" xml:lang="en-US"> 
  <title>Density Factor for Single Core (Sustained)</title> 
  <body> 
	 <p> For calculating the sustained single core power, refer to the Client Sustain T-Sensor Calculator (#<xref href="https://cdrdv2.intel.com/V1/DL/GETCONTENT/860647" format="https" scope="external">860647</xref> ), which is referenced in 
		<xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-2D0FB25D-4B42-4793-B3A7-B1B1CBECA14B.dita">Section 3.5.1</xref>. 
	 </p> 
	 <fig id="FIG_31D2C482E23148FA98D7C8A53FB366F6"><image href="../images/GUID-49718673-F20A-4A6A-A8C9-FAE9B1F79271.png" scalefit="yes" id="IMAGE_048286C2F50842C8B173C6443537CCF2"> 
		  <alt> 
		  </alt></image> 
	 </fig> 
	 <p> Following case can be used as initial reference for cooling needs and density factor (Sustained PL1) usage: 
	 </p> 
	 <table id="TABLE_227DE8B70CDB494695587B207D444538"> 
		<tgroup cols="1"> 
		  <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="*" /> 
		  <thead> 
			 <row> 
				<entry> 
				  <b> Scenario 
				  </b> 
				</entry> 
			 </row></thead> 
		  <tbody> 
			 <row> 
				<entry> 
				  <p> 
				  <ul id="UL_87EBC59542434F0D973DC76ACC33BCFA"> 
					 <li id="LI_FE24BF536E4A4AFBA524AF30E13053D3">T<sub>amb</sub> - 25 °C, T<sub>sys</sub> -11 °C; 
					 </li> 
					 <li id="LI_B087C83E62A5458FB7966E86C0BA44B2">Assume, PTL: Ψ<sub>hp-a</sub> - 0.36 [°C/W]; (iso thermal solution b/w PTL &amp; NVL) 
					 </li> 
					 <li id="LI_AB7EAD3DD631468487146C173EF779FE">PTL and NVL resistance considered (refer section) as above: 
						<ul id="UL_2D9795BE8F3F45DD8C983403776A4111"> 
						  <li id="LI_314B4EB9E029470BA939882E2A041698">PTL-H 484 4X<sup>e</sup>: Ψ<sub>sn-hp</sub> - 4.2 [°C/W] 
						  </li> 
						  <li id="LI_4589BC19B5CD4DCDA70B3A6BA96CDCB2">NVL 16C: Ψ<sub>sn-hp</sub> - 2.81 [°C/W] 
						  </li> 
						</ul> 
					 </li> 
					 <li id="LI_D85C2500F779446B8D4D00E734451DE9">Use 
						<b>Equation 1</b> to find Power supported for NVL 
					 </li> 
				  </ul> 
				  </p> 
				  <b> NVL 16C sustained thermal capability: 20.2W;</b> 
				</entry> 
			 </row> 
			 <row> 
				<entry> 
				  <b> Equation 1</b> 
				  <p> Ψ<sub>sn - a</sub> = Ψ<sub>hp-a</sub> + Ψ<sub>sn -hp</sub>; Power = [T<sub>sn</sub> - T<sub>sys</sub> - T<sub>amb</sub>] / Ψ<sub>sn-a</sub> 
				  </p> 
				</entry> 
			 </row> 
			 <row> 
				<entry> 
				  <note id="GUID-94AB0FCC-3561-400C-BEDB-61528D471C32">This is a first order calculation and needs to be verified through CFD or test. For performing calculations with custom inputs, refer to the Client Sustain T-Sensor Calculator (#<xref href="https://CDRDV2.INTEL.COM/V1/DL/GETCONTENT/860647" scope="external" format="https">860647</xref>). 
				  </note> 
				</entry> 
			 </row> 
		  </tbody> 
		</tgroup> 
	 </table> 
